$end
$version
	ai-dv-fifo milestone 2 test fixture
$end
$comment
	Exercises: X/Z (upper and lower case), shortened vectors, identifier
	aliases, ambiguous leaf names, real values, two changes of one signal
	at the same timestamp, $dumpoff/$dumpon, and a "1 ns" timescale.
$end
$timescale 1 ns $end
$scope module top $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$var wire 8 " bus [7:0] $end
$var reg 4 # state [3:0] $end
$var real 64 $ temp $end
$scope module u0 $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$var wire 8 % bus [7:0] $end
$var wire 1 & en $end
$upscope $end
$scope module u1 $end
$var wire 1 ' en $end
$upscope $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
